---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Now" description="What Viswaroop is building, learning, and reading right now.">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto py-6 md:py-12">
    <!-- Header -->
    <header class="mb-10 pb-6 border-b border-[var(--border-subtle)]">
      <span class="text-xs font-mono text-[var(--accent)] uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold">Activity & Exploration</span>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-bold font-heading text-[var(--text-primary)] mt-1 mb-3">Now</h1>
      <p class="text-sm md:text-base text-[var(--text-secondary)] leading-relaxed">
        Inspired by Derek Sivers' <a href="https://nownownow.com/about" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[var(--accent)] hover:underline">Now page concept</a>. A snapshot of what I'm actively building, learning, and thinking through.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="space-y-10 text-[var(--text-secondary)] leading-relaxed font-sans">
      
      <!-- Building -->
      <section class="craft-card p-6 md:p-8">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold font-heading text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-[var(--accent)] font-mono text-sm">01 /</span> What I'm Building
        </h2>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Refining reference architectures for multi-tenant Agentic AI infrastructure. Specifically, investigating the boundary between LLM execution sandboxes (Firecracker / gVisor), ephemeral machine-to-machine tokens, and relationship-based access control (Zanzibar / Keto).
        </p>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed">
          The goal: ensuring that when an autonomous agent acts asynchronously on behalf of a human user, its blast radius is strictly contained.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Learning -->
      <section class="craft-card p-6 md:p-8">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold font-heading text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-[var(--accent)] font-mono text-sm">02 /</span> What I'm Exploring
        </h2>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Diving deep into the Model Context Protocol (MCP) and custom Context Providers. I'm building operational bridges that pull real-time telemetry, PagerDuty incidents, and cloud infrastructure drift directly into autonomous agent workflows.
        </p>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Also exploring eBPF-based network policy tracing for Kubernetes pods handling high-throughput LLM inferences.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Reading -->
      <section class="craft-card p-6 md:p-8">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold font-heading text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-[var(--accent)] font-mono text-sm">03 /</span> What I'm Reading
        </h2>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Balancing systems design papers with engineering leadership and architecture books:
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs font-mono pl-0 list-none">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-[var(--accent)]">→</span>
            <a href="/blog/2026-01-06-books-to-read-in-2026/" class="text-[var(--text-primary)] hover:text-[var(--accent)] underline decoration-[var(--border-subtle)]">
              Books I Plan to Read in 2026
            </a>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-[var(--accent)]">→</span>
            <a href="/blog/2026-01-05-books-i-read-in-2025/" class="text-[var(--text-primary)] hover:text-[var(--accent)] underline decoration-[var(--border-subtle)]">
              Notes on Books I Read in 2025
            </a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Timestamp -->
      <div class="text-xs font-mono text-[var(--text-muted)] pt-6 border-t border-[var(--border-subtle)] flex items-center justify-between">
        <span>Updated periodically</span>
        <span class="text-[var(--accent)] font-semibold">Late 2026</span>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
